  ultimateText: "Sun Shot: draws for 1s then fires a huge piercing arrow \u2014 3x
    ATK per enemy, +1x per Sun Sigil on the aimed target. Interrupted = no damage."
  passiveText: 'Heavenly Archer Sun Shot: hits on his aimed target stack Sun Sigils
    (max 3, +12% damage each); at 3 sigils the next secondary spends them.'
  minorText: 'Sun Wheel Line Hold: plants an arrow to raise a sun wheel zone; enemies
    inside are slowed, then rooted 0.9s. 10s CD.'
  secondMinorText: 'Nine Arrows as One: 3 pulses x 3 arrows converge on one target
    (0.6x ATK each); interruption loses the rest. 12s CD.'
  thirdMinorText: 'Sunburst Barrage: an arrow blasts for 1x ATK then 3 rays of 0.6x
    ATK hit up to 3 nearby enemies. Cooldown 9s.'
